    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i dont really want to go to the er if i dont have to, it's such a hassle and expensive. it's just hitting me really hard. you mentioned being cautious, but it does feel somewhat similar to my usual bad ones, just way more intense. do u think it's safe if i just take a double dose of the sumatriptan to get ahead of it? maybe 100mg instead of my usual 50mg? i just want the pain to stop.",
