      "content": "it's hard to just sit in a dark room when the pain is this bad. honestly, i'm starting to feel a little bit dizzy too. but i really dont think i need a doctor for a migraine, even if it's a bad one. it always happens like this eventually. is there anything else i can take right now that might help faster? like maybe i can mix some ibuprofen in with the sumatriptan to make it stronger? that's what my friend does when her migraines are bad.",
